WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.468 --> 00:00:05.210
<i>In the previous episode of "Ben 10 Ultimate Alien"...</i>

2
00:00:07.421 --> 00:00:12.132
Face the herald of my coming, 
reborn in my power.

3
00:00:12.439 --> 00:00:17.492
If you are really Vilgax, you nobody 
you don't serve another but yourself.

4
