43
00:04:31.698 --> 00:04:33.048
They move between dimensions.

44
00:04:33.335 --> 00:04:37.743
But mana is multidimensional, 
well at least we have something going in our favor.

45
00:04:41.177 --> 00:04:42.688
How can we help Ben?

46
00:04:44.465 --> 00:04:45.723
By helping George.

47
