Azmuth's sword wounded Dagon.

48
00:04:47.835 --> 00:04:49.520
Maybe he can finish the job.

49
00:04:51.232 --> 00:04:51.918
Good.

50
00:04:51.943 --> 00:04:53.069
You guys want a fight?

51
00:04:53.471 --> 00:04:54.723
You will get it.

52
00:05:04.043 --> 00:05:05.911
You're still fighting.

53
00:05:06.410 --> 00:05:10.584
Is this sublime courage, 
or you are just too unintelligent

54
00:05:10.609 --> 00:05:13.567
to realize how hopeless your struggle is?

55
00:05:14.150 --> 00:05:16.895
That has nothing to do with it, does it?

56
00:05:17.200 --> 00:05:21.122
Anyway, I will 
I'm going to fuck that butt of yours.

57
00:05:21.314 --> 00:05:26.231
Actually, I don't know if you do 
you have a butt in that pile of spaghetti.

58
00:05:26.496 --> 00:05:28.325
Call it a metaphor.

59
00:05:33.196 --> 00:05:34.476
Have you had enough?

60
00:05:34.815 --> 00:05:37.562
It definitely is.

61
00:06:05.187 --> 00:06:07.560
Go back and fight!

62
00:06:08.444 --> 00:06:10.536
You think I'm running away?

63
00:06:12.310 --> 00:06:15.474
Why should I go and 
missed your destruction?

64
00:06:51.808 --> 00:06:53.958
Whatever Ben did, it didn't work.

65
00:06:54.247 --> 00:06:55.169
I don't see him.

66
00:06:55.194 --> 00:06:56.450
You don't think Dagon is...?

67
00:06:56.968 --> 00:06:58.302
Don't rush to conclusions.

68
00:06:58.327 --> 00:07:00.177
He's probably just back to normal.

69
00:07:00.517 --> 00:07:02.817
His sacrifice brought this respite.

70
00:07:02.956 --> 00:07:04.700
I will not let it be in vain.

71
00:07:05.101 --> 00:07:07.433
Dagon, feel my sword!

72
00:07:07.785 --> 00:07:11.480
You are getting extremely busy, knight.

73
00:07:31.896 --> 00:07:34.691
The ultimate Wildmutt!

74
00:07:46.314 --> 00:07:48.917
The shield...won't...last!

75
00:07:51.192 --> 00:07:53.355
We won't be able to defend ourselves 
from another one like that.

76
00:07:53.733 --> 00:07:55.707
How much longer do you think he can last?

77
00:07:57.505 --> 00:07:59.189
I'll let you know a little later.

78
00:08:09.887 --> 00:08:10.970
Save your mana.

79
00:08:11.196 --> 00:08:13.698
I have a feeling we're going to need it 
before the night is over.

80
00:08:14.005 --> 00:08:15.462
You're worried about Vilgax.

81
00:08:15.827 --> 00:08:19.954
I don't want to ignore the giant demon
that casts fire from heaven, but yes.

82
00:08:20.334 --> 00:08:22.564
Vilgax probably has a plan.

83
00:08:22.990 --> 00:08:26.032
Which we will deal with
after we save the world from Dagon.

84
00:08:26.255 --> 00:08:29.942
It makes sense, but I still can't
not to mention what Vilgax is doing.

85
00:08:30.827 --> 00:08:31.879
Is it ready?

86
00:08:32.989 --> 00:08:34.825
Patience, my lord.

87
00:08:34.850 --> 00:08:40.707
An undertaking of this magnitude demands 
the greatest care for every detail.

88
00:08:41.378 --> 00:08:44.707
Fail me today servant
and you will not live to see another day.

89
00:08:45.026 --> 00:08:47.231
I don't doubt that at all.

90
00:08:51.200 --> 00:08:52.379
No threats.

91
00:08:52.472 --> 00:08:54.059
No smart words.

92
00:08:54.398 --> 00:08:57.129
Are you tired George the Triumphant?

93
00:09:00.800 --> 00:09:02.770
Chromastone!

94
00:09:03.589 --> 00:09:04.778
Leave him alone.

95
00:09:05.068 --> 00:09:08.403
He is 2,000 years old, 
and fight ninjas all day.

96
00:09:08.428 --> 00:09:09.926
Of course he got tired!

97
00:09:13.118 --> 00:09:17.067
If you have power left in that sword,
you'd better use it now!

98
00:09:25.212 --> 00:09:25.950
That's it!

99
00:09:25.982 --> 00:09:26.800
I'm done!

100
00:09:27.029 --> 00:09:27.879
Maybe you didn't!

101
00:09:28.085 --> 00:09:29.793
How much power can you absorb?

102
00:09:30.134 --> 00:09:31.129
A lot.

103
00:09:31.520 --> 00:09:32.622
Wait -- why?

104
00:09:32.887 --> 00:09:34.426
I try to improvise.

105
00:09:34.678 --> 00:09:35.879
Magnus vox!

106
00:09:36.358 --> 00:09:37.184
Gwen, what the--

107
00:09:39.305 --> 00:09:40.317
Ohh!

108
00:09:56.253 --> 00:09:58.692
This will not continue.

109
00:10:04.935 --> 00:10:06.442
What kind of sorcery is this?

110
00:10:06.686 --> 00:10:08.981
The clouds cannot protect you from my wrath!

111
00:10:09.546 --> 00:10:12.473
Don't be afraid of the clouds, George.

112
00:10:12.981 --> 00:10:14.918
Fear of lightning.

113
00:10:39.631 --> 00:10:41.994
For a moment we were doing pretty well.

114
00:10:42.352 --> 00:10:45.307
Ben, George...didn't survive the battle.

115
00:10:45.472 --> 00:10:46.682
So now it's all up to us.

116
00:10:47.677 --> 00:10:49.355
We're with you, Ben.

117
00:10:49.591 --> 00:10:50.510
Always.

118
00:10:54.923 --> 00:10:59.674
Such is the fate of all who 
dare to defy Dagon's will.

119
00:11:00.089 --> 00:11:01.862
I'm skeptical...

120
00:11:02.760 --> 00:11:04.096
master.

121
00:11:05.198 --> 00:11:10.104
