122
00:11:10.542 --> 00:11:11.916
I mean.

123
00:11:12.928 --> 00:11:19.190
Today I won a big victory, 
and I am overflowing with generosity.

124
00:11:19.702 --> 00:11:21.487
He begs me for forgiveness.

125
00:11:21.710 --> 00:11:24.565
Humble yourself before my majesty,

126
00:11:24.867 --> 00:11:28.854
and I will give you a less painful death.

127
00:11:29.159 --> 00:11:33.072
Do you really think you would 
let you conquer my universe?

128
00:11:33.730 --> 00:11:38.518
After I destroy you, I will rule yours,
as well as his universe.

129
00:11:38.947 --> 00:11:39.901
Not.

130
00:11:40.290 --> 00:11:46.572
I will destroy your precious weapon,
and then I will send you to an eternity of pain.

131
00:11:46.984 --> 00:11:50.674
Then attack me -- if you dare.

132
00:11:54.367 --> 00:11:55.127
A fool.

133
00:11:55.520 --> 00:11:57.572
I can't stop!

134
00:11:57.965 --> 00:11:59.354
Of course you can't.

135
00:11:59.807 --> 00:12:01.455
That machine is not a weapon.

136
00:12:02.069 --> 00:12:03.690
It's Vox Peniculus.

137
00:12:03.996 --> 00:12:09.002
Under normal circumstances,
this machine just absorbs energy...

138
00:12:09.431 --> 00:12:11.408
he pulls her into him.

139
00:12:11.879 --> 00:12:14.859
But my substance is energy.

140
00:12:15.097 --> 00:12:15.905
Yes.

141
00:12:16.282 --> 00:12:18.784
Much to your chagrin.

142
00:12:30.595 --> 00:12:32.804
You know what to do Psyphone.

143
00:12:33.913 --> 00:12:35.312
Psyphone, don't!

144
00:12:37.188 --> 00:12:40.601
With Dagon's energy added to his own,
Vilgax will be unstoppable!

145
00:12:40.864 --> 00:12:41.882
Yes.

146
00:12:42.262 --> 00:12:45.476
That was the point in the end.

147
00:12:49.769 --> 00:12:50.726
No!

148
00:12:58.089 --> 00:13:02.421
Esoterics adored me 
because I resembled Dagon.

149
00:13:02.846 --> 00:13:05.890
Now I am Dagon.

150
00:13:11.627 --> 00:13:14.382
