152
00:13:22.638 --> 00:13:24.359
Eo recedentia!

153
00:13:38.016 --> 00:13:39.054
I got you.

154
00:13:41.845 --> 00:13:43.273
Good teleportation.

155
00:13:43.461 --> 00:13:45.632
This is the old Vodoinstallerska 
base in South Dakota.

156
00:13:46.433 --> 00:13:47.694
That must be a record.

157
00:13:47.951 --> 00:13:48.609
Yes.

158
00:13:49.037 --> 00:13:50.616
I just wanted to get us out of there.

159
00:13:52.614 --> 00:13:54.179
Drink some juice or something.

160
00:13:54.381 --> 00:13:55.679
You must be exhausted.

161
00:13:56.908 --> 00:13:58.187
How much time do you think we have?

162
00:13:58.617 --> 00:14:01.312
About two minutes to figure it out 
that he didn't disintegrate us,

163
00:14:01.450 --> 00:14:04.476
and some little time to learn
how to use new powers to find us.

164
00:14:05.010 --> 00:14:06.077
Maybe a few days.

165
00:14:06.109 --> 00:14:07.038
Tennyson!

166
00:14:07.344 --> 00:14:09.093
You can't hide from me!

167
00:14:09.402 --> 00:14:10.374
Maybe I'm wrong.

168
00:14:10.991 --> 00:14:13.515
Destroy them, my Esoterics.

169
00:14:19.922 --> 00:14:21.921
I don't like our chances.

170
00:14:22.261 --> 00:14:25.413
You would like them if you did 
you two read the instructions.

171
00:14:25.727 --> 00:14:26.538
Instructions?

172
00:14:26.754 --> 00:14:30.038
Plumbing manual -- instructions
for the self-defense system of this base.

173
00:14:42.909 --> 00:14:44.155
No!

174
00:14:44.247 --> 00:14:46.273
You will not escape from me again!

175
00:15:18.226 --> 00:15:20.210
That's going to be a little hard to cover up.

176
00:15:20.483 --> 00:15:21.546
We have bigger problems!

177
00:15:28.155 --> 00:15:32.882
And here we are again...
me on the verge of total victory,

178
00:15:33.346 --> 00:15:36.319
you last one left

179
00:15:36.699 --> 00:15:41.569
the only thin hope that this 
the world has -- this universe.

180
00:15:41.795 --> 00:15:43.132
Who will it be?

181
00:15:43.456 --> 00:15:45.687
Diamondhead? Swampfire?

182
00:15:46.071 --> 00:15:48.437
One of your boring ones 
the ultimate aliens?

183
00:15:49.084 --> 00:15:52.976
Maybe you have a new transformation 
with which you will surprise me.

184
00:15:53.392 --> 00:15:56.109
No transformations -- not this time.

185
00:15:56.637 --> 00:15:59.262
But I have one last surprise.

186
00:16:02.791 --> 00:16:04.007
Sword of Azmuth!

187
00:16:04.294 --> 00:16:06.757
It matches my watch, doesn't it?

188
00:16:09.035 --> 00:16:11.827
I will miss these little meetings of ours.

189
00:16:15.706 --> 00:16:17.468
This is a very good sword.

190
00:16:17.642 --> 00:16:19.405
I'm not afraid of you.

191
00:16:19.824 --> 00:16:20.913
It should.

192
00:16:21.221 --> 00:16:23.593
I just figured out how to use this.

193
00:16:33.384 --> 00:16:37.101
As my old friend would 
George said, "Get ready to fight!"

194
00:16:58.447 --> 00:17:01.507
Someone had to do this 
a long time ago.

195
00:17:09.303 --> 00:17:11.374
You pierced me.

196
00:17:12.007 --> 00:17:13.405
Don't be a baby.

197
00:17:13.813 --> 00:17:15.780
I just took Dagon's power from you.

198
00:17:16.111 --> 00:17:17.898
You worried us for a moment.

199
00:17:18.267 --> 00:17:19.335
I wasn't worried.

200
00:17:19.805 --> 00:17:21.655
Then you are a fool.

201
00:17:22.261 --> 00:17:29.007
You have the Ultimatrix, the Sword of Azmuth, 
and the power of Dagon under his fingers.

202
00:17:29.297 --> 00:17:30.429
