205
00:17:36.432 --> 00:17:38.968
To return everything on Earth to 
human form, for starters.

206
00:17:39.299 --> 00:17:41.187
You're thinking too small.

207
00:17:41.734 --> 00:17:43.437
You and I are alike.

208
00:17:43.923 --> 00:17:47.148
We have the universe in our hands
and we create from it what we want.

209
00:17:47.596 --> 00:17:49.624
You say you want peace and justice?

210
00:17:49.922 --> 00:17:51.554
Use your power.

211
00:17:52.035 --> 00:17:56.226
With just one thought,
you could erase all evil.

212
00:17:57.363 --> 00:17:58.663
I really could.

213
00:17:58.853 --> 00:18:01.046
Ben.
What are you talking about?

214
00:18:01.500 --> 00:18:04.710
He says it's the end of yours
agony in his hands.

215
00:18:05.171 --> 00:18:07.765
He can create any universe he imagines.

216
00:18:08.778 --> 00:18:09.546
Do it.

217
00:18:09.861 --> 00:18:11.445
Just to erase the evil.

218
00:18:11.803 --> 00:18:12.655
Do it!

219
00:18:12.950 --> 00:18:16.570
Are you really going to listen? 
moral advice from Vilgax?

220
00:18:23.700 --> 00:18:27.023
I thought we had a deal
that we will make all big decisions together.

221
00:18:27.783 --> 00:18:29.280
Ship is a good hunting dog.

222
00:18:29.524 --> 00:18:31.030
That's how you found us, right?

223
00:18:31.322 --> 00:18:32.109
Ship!

224
00:18:32.300 --> 00:18:35.952
You know we all love you Ben 
but if you try and do this,

225
00:18:36.220 --> 00:18:40.976
then you are the same as Vilgax, or 
Dagon or Aggregor or any other.

226
00:18:41.483 --> 00:18:43.109
Would you try to stop me?

227
00:18:43.397 --> 00:18:44.960
We would stop you.

228
00:18:45.521 --> 00:18:46.835
You're not afraid of me?

229
00:18:48.687 --> 00:18:51.366
You never gave me a reason to fear you.

230
00:18:51.597 --> 00:18:53.089
You always told me that I should

231
00:18:53.114 --> 00:18:55.425
using my technology 
to help people.

232
00:18:55.949 --> 00:18:58.812
Now...I can help everyone at once.

233
00:18:59.071 --> 00:19:00.320
Look, there is a limit.

234
00:19:00.867 --> 00:19:02.827
I'm not sure where it is,

235
00:19:03.140 --> 00:19:05.327
but I'm sure you're on 
on the wrong side of that border.

236
00:19:05.618 --> 00:19:08.702
Power is meaningless if not used.

237
00:19:09.274 --> 00:19:10.155
Do it.

238
00:19:10.398 --> 00:19:11.507
You shut up!

239
00:19:12.379 --> 00:19:13.476
Can't you see, Ben?

240
00:19:13.604 --> 00:19:14.546
That's power.

241
00:19:14.772 --> 00:19:17.593
You are tempted -- as I am 
I was tempted to become Anodite.

242
00:19:17.919 --> 00:19:20.531
And like when I lost 
control over my powers.

243
00:19:20.958 --> 00:19:23.101
You can't be all people 
force your answer.

244
00:19:23.314 --> 00:19:24.915
After everything we've been through together,

245
00:19:24.993 --> 00:19:26.970
is this the way to 
which one do you want to end?

246
00:19:27.202 --> 00:19:28.679
Everyone stop talking!

247
00:19:28.769 --> 00:19:29.891
Let me think!

248
00:20:16.865 --> 00:20:18.062
What did you do?

249
00:20:18.364 --> 00:20:20.195
What I said I was going to do...

250
00:20:20.711 --> 00:20:23.679
I returned all the Esoterics 
on Earth back to humans...

251
00:20:24.314 --> 00:20:26.968
with all the free will that goes with it.

252
00:20:29.471 --> 00:20:30.570
Oh, Ben!

253
00:20:32.684 --> 00:20:35.718
It was totally worth it 
rejection of all those powers.

254
00:20:38.536 --> 00:20:39.999
I knew you'd do the right thing.

255
00:20:40.263 --> 00:20:41.296
All the best.

256
00:20:43.862 --> 00:20:46.757
Now all that's left is for me 
to figure out what to do with this.

257
00:20:49.952 --> 00:20:52.530
I suggest you return it to the creator.

258
00:20:52.555 --> 00:20:53.484
Azmut!

259
00:21:00.515 --> 00:21:01.413
You were right.

260
00:21:01.808 --> 00:21:03.265
That's too much power for any--

261
00:21:04.233 --> 00:21:04.827
What?

262
00:21:05.046 --> 00:21:07.218
Ultimatrix -- give it to me.

263
00:21:12.723 --> 00:21:15.359
But, Azmut, I thought I was 
proved that I'm worth it.

264
00:21:15.732 --> 00:21:17.860
As usual, you don't understand anything.

265
00:21:18.148 --> 00:21:19.702
You've proven yourself worthy.

